/// Returns the index of the first odd element in a non-empty vector, or None if no odd elements exist.
/// An integer is odd if its remainder when divided by 2 is nonzero.
///
/// # Specification
/// - If returns Some(i): 
///     - i is a valid index in `a`
///     - a[i] is odd (a[i] % 2 != 0)
